OL,3,GNEWSARequest to land 120 migrants
OL,4,Adenied by two ports
OL,5,
OL,6,FRequests to accept the landing of 120
OL,7,Fmigrants intercepted off the Isle of
OL,8,FWight were refused by both Portsmouth
OL,9,Fharbour and Southampton Port.
OL,11,FWhen the migrants were landed on Sunday
OL,12,Fat Eastney, in Langstone Harbour,
OL,13,Fanti-migrant protesters blocked the
OL,14,Froad.
OL,16,FAssociated British Ports (ABP), which
OL,17,Foperates Southampton, said it was not
OL,18,Fthe closest port and it "did not have
OL,19,Fsuitable reception facilities
OL,20,Favailable".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
