OL,3,GNEWSARequest to land 120 migrants
OL,4,Adenied by two ports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands the King's Harbour
OL,7,FMaster (KHM) Portsmouth also declined a
OL,8,Fcoastguard request, but it would not
OL,9,Fcomment directly on operational
OL,10,Fmatters.
